          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p text:style-name="P">법령안 전문 및 제·개정내용, 신·구조문 대비표, 법령안 설명자료</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
