          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p text:style-name="P">정책 관련 참고자료, 관련 통계(승인통계, 행정자료, 내부 보유자료 등)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
