          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p text:style-name="P">◦ 정책에 필요한 통계지표 구비, 통계개발·개선계획 필요성 여부를 기재</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
