          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p text:style-name="P">▪ 정책명<text:line-break/>▪ □□□ □ □□□<text:line-break/>▪ 정책의 주요내용<text:line-break/>  - 도입근거<text:line-break/>  - 추진방향<text:line-break/>  - 세부내용(현행/변경)<text:line-break/>▪ 기대효과</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
