          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p text:style-name="P">▪ 통계지표<text:line-break/>  - 지표구분(집행/평가 지표)<text:line-break/>  - 유용성<text:line-break/>  - 정보출처<text:line-break/>  - 작성방식</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
