          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="8"><text:p text:style-name="P">▪ 통계지표명<text:line-break/>▪ 통계작성 및 자료수집방법: □ 조사  □ 보고  □ 가공<text:line-break/>▪ 통계작성 목적<text:line-break/>▪ 법적근거<text:line-break/>▪ 통계작성 대상<text:line-break/>▪ 통계작성 사항<text:line-break/>▪ 통계작성 주기<text:line-break/>▪ 통계작성 체계<text:line-break/>▪ 추진일정(계획수립, 조사시기, 공표시기 등)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
